cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as follows."
title: "BP-KMeans: Refining Pre-Partitioned Data under Hard Group Constraints"
abstract: >-
  We study clustering applications in which data are already partitioned into
  meaningful groups and the objective is to refine those groups into a larger
  number of clusters without allowing any final cluster to cross the original
  group boundaries. We propose BP-KMeans, a progressive groupwise refinement
  framework that incrementally allocates additional clusters to selected groups
  until a target number of clusters is reached. The method satisfies the
  group-consistency constraint by construction and separates group selection
  from the initialization strategy used to refit a selected group.
authors:
